100 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (1.1 The Competition highlights the importance of conducting due diligence in complex business transactions. In this edition, Due Diligence is being conducted on the erroneous clauses of a Share Purchase Agreement \(SPA\) supplemented by a negotiation round, in order to finalize the clauses of the SPA between the concerned parties. The Competition aims to equip law students with practical skills for identifying, analysing, and mitigating legal and commercial risks in complex business transactions by simulating a real-world due diligence scenario.  1.2 The Competition is designed to provide participants with hands-on experience in legal due diligence, negotiation strategy, and team collaboration; all within a setting reflecting the challenges of modern commercial law practices.     )
/E (1.1 The Competition highlights the importance of conducting due diligence in complex business transactions. In this edition, Due Diligence is being conducted on the erroneous clauses of a Share Purchase Agreement \(SPA\) supplemented by a negotiation round, in order to finalize the clauses of the SPA between the concerned parties. The Competition aims to equip law students with practical skills for identifying, analysing, and mitigating legal and commercial risks in complex business transactions by simulating a real-world due diligence scenario.  1.2 The Competition is designed to provide participants with hands-on experience in legal due diligence, negotiation strategy, and team collaboration; all within a setting reflecting the challenges of modern commercial law practices.     )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3 4 5]
>>
endobj
